This repository is a modified downstream distribution containing low-code,
workflow, internationalization, and foundation maintenance changes. Source
files inherited from the maintained downstream baseline may differ from upstream.

Changes made specifically for this public distribution: internal records and
assistant state excluded; infrastructure examples and credentials sanitized;
historical data removed from SQL dumps; fresh local-demo identities provided;
public documentation added. Private Git history is not included.

Third-party dependencies and bundled assets retain their respective licenses.
